      "Stand up. A SENSOR notices. An ACTUATOR reacts. Pick roles.",
      "Sensor mimes a button press. Actuator throws both arms up.",
      "New trigger: sensor mimes a shake. Actuator waves both hands.",
      "Swap jobs and run both signals again.",
      "Say it: the press is INPUT, the reaction is OUTPUT.",
      "When THIS happens, do THAT. That rule is an EVENT."
