      "id": "r4",
      "title": "Rung 4 — The Vanishing Ghost",
      "target": "Your challenge: on a shake, show the ghost for one second, then clear it.",
      "hint": "Order matters inside 'on shake': show icon, then pause (ms) 1000, then clear screen. The pause gives the ghost time on screen. Without it, the clear wipes it at once. Your A heart stays because nothing clears it.",
