   "title": "Exit Check",
   "minutes": 2,
   "config": {
    "intro": "They are marked. Answer on your own: your teacher sees how the class did.",
    "items": [
     {
      "id": "ex2-1",
      "stem": "Let's say you've built a program from the following instructions:\n`on button A pressed → show heart`\nYou press button A on the micro:bit but nothing appears. What is the MOST likely reason?",
      "options": [
       "The battery is flat",
       "You forgot to flash the code onto the micro:bit",
       "The heart icon doesn't exist",
       "Button A only works if you press button B at the same time"
      ]
     },
     {
      "id": "ex2-2",
      "stem": "Here is what your finished program does:\n`press button A → a heart appears on the LED grid`\nWhich part of that is the INPUT?",
      "options": [
       "Pressing button A",
       "The heart appearing",
       "The LED grid",
       "The micro:bit itself"
      ]
     }
    ],
    "help": "Two marked questions about today. Answer on your own — your teacher sees how the class did. Your verdicts arrive once the whole report is filed, at the end of the last screen.",
    "job": "Answer two marked questions on your own.",
    "showMe": [
